OL,3,GNEWSA'Terrifying' 101-acre data centre
OL,4,Aplans would be 'heartbreaking',
OL,5,Acampaigners warn
OL,6,
OL,7,FA proposed data centre spanning 101
OL,8,Facres would have a "heartbreaking"
OL,9,Feffect on the landscape and wildlife,
OL,10,Fcampaigners have warned.
OL,12,FDevelopers want to build the new centre
OL,13,Fbetween Caernarfon and Y Felinheli in
OL,14,FGwynedd, saying it could create more
OL,15,Fthan 900 jobs during construction and a
OL,16,Ffurther 200 permanent roles.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
